    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/e3a18a056f4c0163aedc3cba2427f9b2.poster.avif?t=1694182114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/e3a18a056f4c0163aedc3cba2427f9b2.webm?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/e3a18a056f4c0163aedc3cba2427f9b2.mp4?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become the Edgeweaver in <strong>TENSE</strong>: a white-knuckle brawler featuring an arsenal unlike any you've seen before. But something isn't quite right: your life drains over time, your foes revive, and your weapons shatter. Can you endure and save the world? No Breaks, No Rules, No Mercy.<br><br>Indecision means failure - keep moving, fighting, and clearing rooms to get closer to perfection each run.<br><br><strong><u>RESTORE THE BALANCE OF GUNFU AND HUGFU</u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/0dda785730f41f43f5803acfc5f376a5.poster.avif?t=1694182114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/0dda785730f41f43f5803acfc5f376a5.webm?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/0dda785730f41f43f5803acfc5f376a5.mp4?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Pre-Alpha Footage</i><br><br>The overwhelming influence of GunFu has tainted the world into a chaotic nightmare disguised as a playful fa\u00e7ade. Killing has become inconsequential. Relationships have become meaningless. Awaken the transformative power of HugFu and embark on a one-of-a-kind journey of self discovery. You'll make a lot of quirky but lovable new friends along the way!<br><br><strong><u>UNLEASH THE EDGEWEAVER'S ARSENAL</u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/fba19fd20eb20a38c1263c94fb2ea2c2.poster.avif?t=1694182114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/fba19fd20eb20a38c1263c94fb2ea2c2.webm?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/fba19fd20eb20a38c1263c94fb2ea2c2.mp4?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Pre-Alpha Footage</i><br><br>The Edgeweaver is lethal with genre-breaking weapons, but juggling resources and finishing enemies is a strategic necessity to survive. Weapons can be taken from foes - but used a limited amount of time before they break. To make matters worse, your health is constantly draining. Can you overcome the odds?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/f8d64a0d7f36c8f7cf9f4c4032ae185d.avif?t=1694182114\" /></span><br><br>Prepare for a brand new white-knuckle roguelite experience. Things are going to get <strong>TENSE!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/6e363259a36a41c8070a81cfc9996f2d.avif?t=1694182114\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/e3a18a056f4c0163aedc3cba2427f9b2.poster.avif?t=1694182114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/e3a18a056f4c0163aedc3cba2427f9b2.webm?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/e3a18a056f4c0163aedc3cba2427f9b2.mp4?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Become the Edgeweaver in <strong>TENSE</strong>: a white-knuckle brawler featuring an arsenal unlike any you've seen before. But something isn't quite right: your life drains over time, your foes revive, and your weapons shatter. Can you endure and save the world? No Breaks, No Rules, No Mercy.<br><br>Indecision means failure - keep moving, fighting, and clearing rooms to get closer to perfection each run.<br><br><strong><u>RESTORE THE BALANCE OF GUNFU AND HUGFU</u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/0dda785730f41f43f5803acfc5f376a5.poster.avif?t=1694182114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/0dda785730f41f43f5803acfc5f376a5.webm?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/0dda785730f41f43f5803acfc5f376a5.mp4?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Pre-Alpha Footage</i><br><br>The overwhelming influence of GunFu has tainted the world into a chaotic nightmare disguised as a playful fa\u00e7ade. Killing has become inconsequential. Relationships have become meaningless. Awaken the transformative power of HugFu and embark on a one-of-a-kind journey of self discovery. You'll make a lot of quirky but lovable new friends along the way!<br><br><strong><u>UNLEASH THE EDGEWEAVER'S ARSENAL</u></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/fba19fd20eb20a38c1263c94fb2ea2c2.poster.avif?t=1694182114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/fba19fd20eb20a38c1263c94fb2ea2c2.webm?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/fba19fd20eb20a38c1263c94fb2ea2c2.mp4?t=1694182114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Pre-Alpha Footage</i><br><br>The Edgeweaver is lethal with genre-breaking weapons, but juggling resources and finishing enemies is a strategic necessity to survive. Weapons can be taken from foes - but used a limited amount of time before they break. To make matters worse, your health is constantly draining. Can you overcome the odds?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/f8d64a0d7f36c8f7cf9f4c4032ae185d.avif?t=1694182114\" /></span><br><br>Prepare for a brand new white-knuckle roguelite experience. Things are going to get <strong>TENSE!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407960/extras/6e363259a36a41c8070a81cfc9996f2d.avif?t=1694182114\" /></span>",
